        "created_at": "2018-03-24T13:48:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I forgot to mention that Biomancer and Madame Mittermeier is a thing in my mind after the Carnival ep. Them having a mystical jerkass frenemies with benefits thing going on amuses me.</p><p>Also I like Baron Blade and Citizen Dawn having a casual thing going on where each keeps trying to recruit the other now and then just for the sake of ritual.</p>",
