      {
        "id": 238226,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-06-06T19:16:33.041Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ship Legacy and Fanatic, not because I particularly like them together, but just because they seem like an obvious match.  It requires Senator Emily Parsons to die, and enough time for Legs and Fanny to get over the losses of Mrs. Legacy and the Hottest of Hot Guys respectively.  But once that’s done, I can’t help but think Mr. America and Mrs. Christianity are just an obvious combo.  Plus I dig interracial couples and a hot latina with wings has to be a spicy dish to Captain Whitebread, even if he’d never think of it in those terms in a million years.</p>",
