        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"The_Justifier\" data-post=\"75\" data-topic=\"9135\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/48/4954_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> The_Justifier:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Plus I dig interracial couples and a hot latina with wings has to be a spicy dish to Captain Whitebread</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I choose to imagine this happening in the Telenovela Verse, in the style of <em>Modern Family</em>.</p>",
